<title>USA: Permanent Bancorp raises payout.</title>
<headline>Permanent Bancorp raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Permanent Bancorp Inc said Thursday it raised its quarterly dividend to $0.10 per share from $0.075 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it has not yet set a date for the dividend to be paid, nor has it set a record date.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
